      "omegaBannerUrl": "",
      "readmeExcerpt": "# Honorific Cycle\n\nHonorific Cycle is a Dalamud plugin for rotating custom Honorific titles.\n\nIt lets users create multiple titles and cycle through them automatically. Each title can have its own duration and Honorific style.\n\nSupported Honorific options:\n\n- Prefix or suffix\n- Title color\n- Solid glow\n- Preset gradients\n- Two-color gradients\n- Gradient animation style\n\nCommands:\n\n```text\n/honorificcycle\n/hcycle\n/hcycle add\n/hcycle clear\n/hcycle apply\n```\n\nHonorific must be installed and loaded for the title IPC calls to work.",
      "title": "honorific-cycle",
      "url": "https://github.com/Nainaiowo/honorific-cycle"
    }
  },
